# playpick: mode=raid boss=flasks spec=druid:feral style=mash size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# The Two Flasks has only ever been read at 10-normal (raid mode) and via the
# daily framing at 25-normal/25-heroic under good, mash, idle and wander on
# other specs; the one prior 25-heroic reading of this boss at all was
# mode=walk under hunter:marksmanship/flee, which never actually fought it
# (stopped by THE VIGIL). This is the first raid-mode (not daily) 25-heroic
# pull of it, the first druid:feral pull outside the daily framing (its one
# prior reading was daily/dodge on a different boss), and the first touch
# portrait viewport for this spec. carried is fresh-in-disguise within one
# playbot invocation per #273, so the invite hash is what actually reaches
# this cell.
open #b=flasks&s=25&h=1
targets
